<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>No need for doubt or anxious care,</l><l>Just seek His kingdom and righteousness fore’er.</l><l>Daily needs compelling,</l><l>All to Him I’m telling,</l><l>And His peace, so rich and deep,</l><l>Preserves me safe and keeps me constantly.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Always rejoice, ceaselessly pray,</l><l>In all give thanks, ’tis the all-excelling way.</l><l>Christ’s the living fountain,</l><l>My supply abundant,</l><l>All to His hand I entrust, and</l><l>He’ll preserve and keep me to the end.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
